  "details": "I noticed when making my own groups I had no option to make the group \"age verified only joiners\" which means I would have to shift through everyone who wants to join to see if they're age verified or not. \n\nI'd like to see an option for groups where only age verified people can join them. instead of having to sit there and do it yourself. also I'd like to there to be a search function for the group searches if this does happen. a button that filters all the groups so only age verified groups show up. make it easier for adults to find other adults.",
